### 4. TWO PARSING APIs

**Streaming API (SAX-like) - Fastest:**
```rust
use udon_core::Parser;

Parser::new(b"|div Hello\n  |span nested").parse(|event| {
println!("{}", event.format_line());
});
```

**Tree API (DOM-like) - Navigable:**
```rust
use udon_core::tree::Document;

let doc = Document::parse(b"|div\n  |span Hello").unwrap();
for node in doc.root().children() {
if let Some(el) = node.as_element() {
println!("Element: {}", el.name());
}
}
```

